  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_PATRIAN_AWAKENING": "The Patrian Awakening",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_PATRIAN_AWAKENING_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once: the Patrians are born as your vassal, +4 attitude toward you.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Two cities: the first next to the Remnants of Patria (outside other civilizations' borders), the second within 4 plots of them. Without such Remnants: two cities on the largest unowned region.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: the Archon, an Archmage with Hero and magic 80.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]A caster the Patrians train starts at level 3 with Channeling II. Every Patrian city has a Mage Guild.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_PATRIAN_AWAKENING_PEDIA": "Beneath the broken towers of Patria the last archmages of the old kingdom did not die. They slept, bound in their own wards, waiting for a hand to break the seal.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: wake them before a rival settles by the Remnants; the Archon and casters that start at level 3 are a mage corps from their first turn.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_PATRIAN_AWAKENING": "The Patrian Awakening",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_PATRIAN_AWAKENING_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The Patrians are born as your vassal (+4 attitude toward you), in two cities by the Remnants of Patria, else on the largest unowned region.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]They start with the Archon, a Mage, two Adepts, two Longbowmen and a Worker.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_PALACE_PATRIANS": "Palace",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_ARCHON": "Archon",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_ARCHON_PEDIA": "The Archon was the first of the Patrian magisters, and the last to wake. Its wards outlasted the kingdom that raised them.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_ARCHON_STRATEGY": "A caster far above any mage of its era: keep it behind the line.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_PATRIANS_DESC": "Patrian Magocracy",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_PATRIANS_SHORT_DESC": "Patria",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_PATRIANS_ADJECTIVE": "Patrian",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_PATRIANS_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]A caster it trains starts at level 3 with Channeling II.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Its palace gives every city of its a Mage Guild.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: the Archon (magic 80).",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_PATRIANS_PEDIA": "The Patrians are the heirs of a kingdom of mages that fell before the Age of Ice. Woken from the Remnants of Patria, they rebuild their order around the towers and guilds of the old learning.",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_1": "Aurel",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_2": "Vessanthe",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_3": "Corinal",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_4": "Tharsis Minor",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_5": "Ostrava",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_6": "Lumen",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_7": "Calvaris",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_PATRIANS_8": "Serenth",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_AURELIAN": "Aurelian",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_AURELIAN_PEDIA": "Magister Aurelian kept the wards of Patria through the long sleep. Awake, he means to see the old schools filled again."
  }
}
